{"availability":"available","full":"0xmortuex/ai-proxy-demo","name":"ai-proxy-demo","description":"Single-file test client for my ai-proxy Cloudflare Worker - streaming and non-streaming chat, explicit loading and error states, no API key in the page.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-19T09:24:22Z","updated":"2026-07-19T09:33:35Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["cloudflare-workers","demo"],"demo":"https://ai-proxy.mortuexhavoc.workers.dev**/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T19:06:34.902Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T19:06:34.902Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T19:06:34.902Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:00:39.052Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T21:03:11.899Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T19:06:34.902Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A single-page test client for the Cloudflare Worker AI proxy at","The Worker exposes GET /health and POST /v1/chat, forwards chat requests to the Anthropic Messages API with the API key injected server-side, and returns { ok, data }. No API key lives in this page — it never should.","index.html is one self-contained file (no framework, no build step): a prompt textarea, a non-streaming Send, a streaming Send (stream), explicit loading / success / error states (errors show the real HTTP status and raw body), and a per-session request counter to track the Worker's 20-requests-per-hour limit."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/0xmortuex/ai-proxy-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fc9fced4cce32f2b2bbb044cc3f7083951085067dd875031f1fe4c640cd239bb","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:39.237Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:00:39.237Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A single-page test client for the Cloudflare Worker AI proxy at","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/0xmortuex/ai-proxy-demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requir